    {
      "id": "text3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 240,
      "y": 426,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2b8a3e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "KANGAROO (inside CacheLib)\n\nKLog: small log-structured cache absorbs new writes\ncheaply, drops objects nobody re-requests\n\nKSet: large set-associative cache — only objects\nthat survive KLog get promoted here\n\nFlash only pays the page-write once an object has\nproven it's worth keeping. DRAM only indexes survivors.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "KANGAROO (inside CacheLib)\n\nKLog: small log-structured cache absorbs new writes\ncheaply, drops objects nobody re-requests\n\nKSet: large set-associative cache — only objects\nthat survive KLog get promoted here\n\nFlash only pays the page-write once an object has\nproven it's worth keeping. DRAM only indexes survivors.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "footnote",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 670,
      "width": 1160,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "On real Facebook + Twitter production traces: DRAM footprint of the best DRAM-optimized design, flash-write footprint of\nthe best write-optimized design — at the same time — and 29% fewer misses than the prior state of the art.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "On real Facebook + Twitter production traces: DRAM footprint of the best DRAM-optimized design, flash-write footprint of\nthe best write-optimized design — at the same time — and 29% fewer misses than the prior state of the art.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
